# U27 fallback weights with variable rolls: Glorious Vanity on 61834; Generate (the multi-stat nodes get one
# describeStats line and mod list per stat, buildStatModLists, cached in the legion tables as
# modListGenerated), show the fallback list, Generate again (the cached lists), then the build XML.
#! u27-rust-misc-calc
#! u27-expect-text ^4Fallback Nodes
screen 1920 1080 dpi 1.5
fixture userdir=user
fixture net=net.json
frames 2
load-build "Builds/gv.xml"
frames 3
move 699 706
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 880 306
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 300 394
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 880 306
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 560 360
frames 1
snapshot generate_gv
frames 1
